00:08:37.227 --> 00:08:37.260
PEOPLE THOUGHT PEOPLE THOUGHT AD

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:37.293
PEOPLE THOUGHT PEOPLE THOUGHT AB

00:08:37.293 --> 00:08:38.127
PEOPLE THOUGHT PEOPLE THOUGHT AE

00:08:37.527 --> 00:08:38.461
COMMUNICATED BY SIMILE TOUCHING

00:08:38.261 --> 00:08:39.095
SOMEONE.

