A LOT OF THESE BABIES WERE

00:08:39.229 --> 00:08:40.263
LACKING CONTACT.

00:08:39.696 --> 00:08:41.064
SHE WENT AND DID THAT BECAUSE

00:08:40.396 --> 00:08:41.798
SHE WANTED TO SET AN EXAMPLE AND

00:08:41.197 --> 00:08:43.199
MAKE IT CLEAR THAT THIS IS ONE

00:08:41.931 --> 00:08:44.767
OF THE THINGS, THIS WOMAN, SHE

00:08:43.333 --> 00:08:47.103
MAY HAVE WORN FAKE PEARLS AND

00:08:44.901 --> 00:08:48.271
SHE MAY HAVE HAD GRAY HAIR, BUT

00:08:47.237 --> 00:08:50.974
SHE HAD A RESPECT FOR EVERY

00:08:48.404 --> 00:08:52.075
SINGLE HUMAN BEING AND WHICH SHE

00:08:51.107 --> 00:08:55.245
CAME IN CONTACT AND EXPECTED

00:08:52.208 --> 00:08:56.446
OTHER PEOPLE TO HAVE THAT SAME

00:08:55.378 --> 00:08:57.814
MUTUAL RESPECT FOR EVERY ONE OF

00:08:56.579 --> 00:08:58.581
GOD'S CREATURES AND EVERY ONE OF

00:08:57.947 --> 00:09:00.116
GOD'S PEOPLE.

00:08:58.715 --> 00:09:02.986
I THOUGHT IT WAS A POWERFUL

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:04.988
MOMENT WHEN SHE DID THAT, AND

00:09:03.119 --> 00:09:06.756
EMBLEMATIC OF THIS GREAT AND

00:09:05.121 --> 00:09:07.590
NOBLE WOMAN WHO SERVED OUR

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:08.791
COUNTRY.

00:09:07.724 --> 00:09:11.327
SHE WAS VERY PATRIOTIC.

00:09:08.925 --> 00:09:12.662
SHE LOVED AMERICA DEEPLY, AND

00:09:11.461 --> 00:09:14.397
CHERISHED THE GREAT VALUES THAT

00:09:12.795 --> 00:09:15.465
WE HAVEN'T OUR FREEDOMS AND

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:16.799
WANTED OTHERS TO ENJOY AND

00:09:15.598 --> 00:09:19.068
RESPECT IN THIS WORLD.

00:09:16.933 --> 00:09:19.602
&gt;&gt; Laura: SHE WAS PART OF THE

00:09:19.202 --> 00:09:21.237
GREATEST GENERATION.

00:09:19.736 --> 00:09:23.539
SHE AND GEORGE H.W. BUSH.

00:09:21.371 --> 00:09:24.507
&gt;&gt; THE WHOLE STORY OF A ROMANCE,

00:09:23.673 --> 00:09:27.877
REALLY DECIDING TO GET MARRIED

00:09:24.641 --> 00:09:30.213
AND THEN HIM GOING OFF TO WAR,

00:09:28.011 --> 00:09:31.381
THE YOUNGEST PILOTS IN

00:09:30.346 --> 00:09:32.515
WORLD WAR II SHOT DOWN, LUCKILY

00:09:31.514 --> 00:09:34.951
SAVED BY AN AMERICAN SUBMARINE.

00:09:32.649 --> 00:09:35.418
THERE'S A LOT TO THEIR WHOLE

00:09:35.084 --> 00:09:37.153
LIFETIME.

00:09:35.551 --> 00:09:38.755
MOVING TO TEXAS, WHICH BACK

00:09:37.287 --> 00:09:39.923
THEN, FOR THEM, WAS A PRETTY

00:09:38.888 --> 00:09:41.925
RADICAL MOVE.

00:09:40.056 --> 00:09:43.059
RUNNING FOR CONGRESS, SERVING AS

00:09:42.058 --> 00:09:49.132
HEAD OF THE CIA, EVERYWHERE HE

00:09:43.192 --> 00:09:50.934
WENT, SHE WENT.

00:09:49.265 --> 00:09:52.135
&gt;&gt; THEIR HOUSE IN MIDLAND TEXAS,

00:09:51.067 --> 00:09:56.539
IF YOU'VE EVER BEEN THERE, IS A

00:09:52.268 --> 00:09:57.473
VERY MODEST, IT IS PAPER THIN

00:09:56.673 --> 00:10:00.743
WALLS, AND AT ONE POINT THEY

00:09:57.607 --> 00:10:06.282
WERE LIVING NEXT DOOR TO THE

00:10:00.877 --> 00:10:11.955
LOCAL PROSTITUTE WITH WHOM THEY

00:10:06.416 --> 00:10:14.357
SHARE DIFFERENT DOOR.

00:10:12.088 --> 00:10:17.360
&gt;&gt; THEY DON'T USUALLY DO THAT.

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:18.194
THE PEOPLE WHO WORKED FOR THE

00:10:17.493 --> 00:10:19.996
BUSHES LOVED THEM.

00:10:18.328 --> 00:10:21.931
HER SECRET SERVICE NAME WAS

00:10:20.129 --> 00:10:24.734
TRANQUILITY, HER COAT NAME.

00:10:22.065 --> 00:10:26.569
SHE HAD A CERTAIN TOUCH, AS BRIT

00:10:24.867 --> 00:10:26.936
SAID, SHE COULD BE FIERY AND

00:10:26.703 --> 00:10:30.940
SHARP.

00:10:27.070 --> 00:10:33.910
SHE REALLY LOVED PRIVACY.

00:10:31.074 --> 00:10:35.011
WHEN SHE LEFT, SHE WAS HURT IN

00:10:34.043 --> 00:10:36.579
'92, SHE TOLD THE STORY THAT SHE

00:10:35.144 --> 00:10:37.513
WAS IN A STORE AND SOME LADY

00:10:36.713 --> 00:10:39.148
CAME UP AND SAID, AREN'T YOU

00:10:37.647 --> 00:10:42.585
BARBARA BUSH, SHE SAID, NO,

00:10:39.282 --> 00:10:43.586
SHE'S MUCH OLDER THAN ME.

00:10:42.719 --> 00:10:45.021
&gt;&gt; Laura: [LAUGHS]

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:48.124
LET'S END WITH BRIT HUME.

00:10:45.154 --> 00:10:49.726
THERE WAS A MOMENT DURING THE

00:10:48.257 --> 00:10:50.827
2016 CAMPAIGN, WE WERE JUST

00:10:49.859 --> 00:10:53.963
HOWLING OUT EARLIER, MY

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:55.298
PRODUCERS, BECAUSE MRS. BUSH WAS

00:10:54.097 --> 00:10:55.832
TALKING ABOUT WHAT THE COUNTRY

00:10:55.431 --> 00:10:59.936
NEEDS AT THIS POINT.

00:10:55.965 --> 00:11:00.636
LET'S WATCH.

00:11:00.069 --> 00:11:01.237
&gt;&gt; DO YOU THINK THERE IS ROOM

00:11:00.770 --> 00:11:01.637
FOR ANOTHER BUSH IN THE

00:11:01.371 --> 00:11:05.108
WHITE HOUSE?

00:11:01.771 --> 00:11:07.176
&gt;&gt; I THINK THIS IS A GREAT

00:11:05.241 --> 00:11:08.711
AMERICAN COUNTRY, GREAT COUNTRY.

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:12.448
AND IF WE CAN'T FIND MORE THAN

00:11:08.845 --> 00:11:14.650
TWO OR THREE FAMILIES TO RUN FOR

00:11:12.582 --> 00:11:16.986
HIGH OFFICE, THAT'S SILLY.

00:11:14.784 --> 00:11:19.288
&gt;&gt; Laura: [LAUGHS]

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:21.524
WE HAVE JEB BUSH RUNNING, AND

00:11:19.422 --> 00:11:21.824
HE'S LIKE, WHAT IS GOING ON

00:11:21.657 --> 00:11:22.191
