00:11:21.958 --> 00:11:24.594
HILARIOUS.

00:11:22.325 --> 00:11:25.962
&gt;&gt; SHE WAS LATER TO CHANGE YOUR

00:11:24.727 --> 00:11:29.565
VIEW OF THAT IF YOU MAY RECALL.

00:11:26.095 --> 00:11:30.867
I THINK, AND ALL OF THIS, WE

00:11:29.699 --> 00:11:31.501
SHOULD HAVE A PARTICULARLY

00:11:31.634 --> 00:11:34.270
