00:11:52.522 --> 00:11:58.728
HERE HE IS, AS LATE AS HE IS IN

00:11:56.325 --> 00:12:00.563
HIS LIFE, HAVING TO ENDURE THIS

00:11:58.861 --> 00:12:02.765
LOSS, WE'VE ALL LOST SOMETHING

